e full `docs/solutions/` bodies into the vault — index rows only."},"79":{"id":"/docs/add-a-project-77","page_id":"/docs/add-a-project","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/add-a-project#rules","content":"**Shared / external / contribute-only repos (🤝, e.g. `AleannLab/draw`):** registry + vault note + learnings catalog are OK (Jackie-OS side only). **Never** write a bridge/`docs/solutions/`/CLAUDE.md into the repo, never push/PR to it, never add it to `merge_poll.py`. Sync is read-only via morning-brief."},"80":{"id":"/docs/architecture","page_id":"/docs/architecture","type":"page","content":"Ecosystem Architecture","breadcrumbs":["Docs","What is this system?"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/architecture"},"81":{"id":"/docs/architecture-0","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture","content":"One-screen map of three systems, shared rails, and how Hermes ties them together."},"82":{"id":"/docs/architecture-1","page_id":"/docs/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/architecture#1-jackie-os--the-ai-operating-system","content":"1\\. Jackie-OS — the AI operating system"},"83":{"id":"/docs/architecture-2","page_id":"/docs/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/architecture#roles","content":"Roles"},"84":{"id":"/docs/architecture-3","page_id":"/docs/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/architecture#automation-reality-2026-07-10","content":"Automation reality (2026-07-10)"},"85":{"id":"/docs/architecture-4","page_id":"/docs/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/architecture#1b-llm-gateway--live-profiles-as-of-2026-08-15","content":"1b. LLM Gateway — live profiles (as of 2026-08-15)"},"86":{"id":"/docs/architecture-5","page_id":"/docs/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/architecture#2-newfin--net-worth--trading-desk-devnewfin","content":"2\\. Newfin — net-worth + trading desk (`~/dev/newfin`)"},"87":{"id":"/docs/architecture-6","page_id":"/docs/architecture","type"