tes, not code · Newfin & Rodyna would run without Jackie-OS; Hermes is what makes it one OS."},"95":{"id":"/docs/architecture-14","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#1-jackie-os--the-ai-operating-system","content":"Sergei's always-on OS. The **vault is memory**, **skills are the contract**, **scripts are dumb runners**, **Hermes is the 24/7 instance** on a VPS. &#x2A;*Operator desk:** Cursor + Tailscale + Hermes + Grokbot — Operator desk. History: Desk journey. Tool-agnostic: any agent that opens `~/Jackie-OS` and reads `CLAUDE.md` *becomes* an instance. Hosts four code repos (Newfin, Rodyna, Draw, B-Unit) and multiple products/projects (B-Unit, Peaches Beauty, Nastusha), all synced to the vault via `project-sync`."},"96":{"id":"/docs/architecture-15","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#1-jackie-os--the-ai-operating-system","content":"**Stack:** Obsidian (markdown) · bash/Python runners · Claude Agent SDK · VPS cron (Europe/Warsaw) · git + symlink farm · Telegram Bot API."},"97":{"id":"/docs/architecture-16","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#1-jackie-os--the-ai-operating-system","content":"**Layers:**"},"98":{"id":"/docs/architecture-17","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#1-jackie-os--the-ai-operating-system","content":"**Vault** (`Vault/`) — journals, project notes, briefs, coaching corpus, ops board, `Agent-Learnings/` index. Source of truth."},"99":{"id":"/docs/architecture-18","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#1-jackie-os--the-ai-operating-system","content":"**Skills** (`System/skills/`) — markdown agent specs (morning-brief, project-sync, research, wrap-up, coaching, …)."},"100":{"id":"/docs/architecture-19","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#1-jackie-os--the-ai-operating-system","content":"**Scripts** (`System/{coo,capture,ops,periodic,work,lib}/`) — edited in repo, run on VPS via a **symlink farm** (`~/.hermes/scripts/&#60;name>` → repo). Repo is the source of truth; never edit the VPS copy."},"101":{"id":"/docs/architecture-20","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#1-jackie-os--the-ai-operating-system","content":"**Script groups by function:**"},"102":{"id":"/docs/architecture-21","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#1-jackie-os--the-ai-operating-system","content":"`coo/` — COO ops (brief delivery, Telegram integration, vault index updates)"},"103":{"id":"/docs/architecture-22","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#1-jackie-os--the-ai-operating-system","content":"`capture/` — journal capture, Telegram sweep, trade digest, meeting capture"},"104":{"id":"/docs/architecture-23","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#1-jackie-os--the-ai-operating-system","content":"`ops/` — VPS service health, Hermes ops proxy, code exec gate, notify endpoint"},"105":{"id":"/docs/architecture-24","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#1-jackie-os--the-ai-operating-system","content":"`periodic/` — intel weekly, codebase index (`cbm`), janitor maintenance"},"106":{"id":"/docs/architecture-25","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#1-jackie-os--the-ai-operating-system","content":"`work/` — ad-hoc agent work (code ask, wrap-up ops)"},"107":{"id":"/docs/architecture-26","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#1-jackie-os--the-ai-operating-system","content":"`lib/` — shared utilities (env loader, logging helpers)"},"108":{"id":"/docs/architecture-27","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#1-jackie-os--the-ai-operating-system","content":"**Sec