nce of that same agent."},"129":{"id":"/docs/architecture-48","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#automation-reality-2026-07-10","content":"Three automation layers (a job must never live in multiple, or it double-runs). The VPS owns everything; Cowork on the Mac is **effectively retired** — one leftover schedule (weekly-review) is all that remains:"},"130":{"id":"/docs/architecture-49","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#automation-reality-2026-07-10","content":"Layer"},"131":{"id":"/docs/architecture-50","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#automation-reality-2026-07-10","content":"Jobs"},"132":{"id":"/docs/architecture-51","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#automation-reality-2026-07-10","content":"**Hermes Agent cron** (`hermes cron list`)"},"133":{"id":"/docs/architecture-52","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#automation-reality-2026-07-10","content":"`morning-brief` (07:30) · `journal-capture` (hourly) · `telegram-sweep` (07:00) · `trade-digest` (07:10) — **4 jobs**"},"134":{"id":"/docs/architecture-53","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#automation-reality-2026-07-10","content":"**OS crontab** (`crontab -l`, `hermes` user)"},"135":{"id":"/docs/architecture-54","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#automation-reality-2026-07-10","content":"autodeploy (`*/2`) · merge-poll (\\~2h) · healthcheck (08:00) · degraded-brief (08:35) · intel-weekly (Sun) · cbm-index (Sun) · janitor (quarterly)"},"136":{"id":"/docs/architecture-55","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#automation-reality-2026-07-10","content":"**Mac weekly-review** (last Cowork schedule)"},"137":{"id":"/docs/architecture-56","page_id":"/docs/architecture